    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/81ac002f43ef5576ab9573fe68c57bfe.poster.avif?t=1718089592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/81ac002f43ef5576ab9573fe68c57bfe.webm?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/81ac002f43ef5576ab9573fe68c57bfe.mp4?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How many times do I have to end the world before I can see you again?</strong></h2><br>In a classroom bathed in the setting sun,<br>a young girl announces that the world is about to end.<br><br>There is only one way to survive:<br>by ending the &quot;worlds that refuse to die&quot; that are parallel to this world.<br><br>Who is this girl?<br>Why is the world ending?<br>What are the worlds that refuse to die?<br>Why would ending parallel worlds lead to survival?<br><br>In the epic battle for &quot;destiny&quot; that endlessly repeats itself,<br>all the mysteries of the world weave a single story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.poster.avif?t=1718089592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.webm?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.mp4?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Concept</h2>&quot;I have to go to work in a few hours...But I want to play a game! I want to clear the game! I want to be impressed!&quot;<br>The is &quot;super-concentrated action entertainment&quot; made for gamers who are exhausted from their work.<br><br>Clear the game loop in as little as 10 minutes, no game overs, super-concentrated action entertainment for busy working adults.<br>A breathless, furious action game in a dying world, an action adventure game where your discoveries and actions unravel a complex and intertwined world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.poster.avif?t=1718089592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.webm?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.mp4?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Action and the Adventure</h2>At a glance, this game may look like any other 3D action game. But if you look closer, it's actually an action adventure game that mixes escape puzzle game elements into the action.<br><br>If you make it rain in this world, the desert in another might turn into a forest.<br>If you lose to a boss on purpose, you might gain an advantage against another.<br><br>Your own discoveries and choices are the key to solving the puzzle of these three intertwined worlds, across more than ten different stages which all affect one another.<br><br>When you clear all 30+ routes and finally reach the true ending, you're guaranteed to be filled with an overwhelming sense of accomplishment when all the puzzle pieces fall into place.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/badabe5cec0d6eac30f0993054214d03.poster.avif?t=1718089592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/badabe5cec0d6eac30f0993054214d03.webm?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/badabe5cec0d6eac30f0993054214d03.mp4?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can clear the game before going to bed in as little as 10 minutes.<br></li><li>No tutorial, easy controls and exhilarating action.<br></li><li>Stress-free design with no game over even if you lose to a boss.<br></li><li>Play around to solve the mystery, the world keeps changing by player's choice.</li></ul><br>Enjoy a completely new game experience that fits into the small gaps in today's entertainment-filled society.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/81ac002f43ef5576ab9573fe68c57bfe.poster.avif?t=1718089592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/81ac002f43ef5576ab9573fe68c57bfe.webm?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/81ac002f43ef5576ab9573fe68c57bfe.mp4?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How many times do I have to end the world before I can see you again?</strong></h2><br>In a classroom bathed in the setting sun,<br>a young girl announces that the world is about to end.<br><br>There is only one way to survive:<br>by ending the &quot;worlds that refuse to die&quot; that are parallel to this world.<br><br>Who is this girl?<br>Why is the world ending?<br>What are the worlds that refuse to die?<br>Why would ending parallel worlds lead to survival?<br><br>In the epic battle for &quot;destiny&quot; that endlessly repeats itself,<br>all the mysteries of the world weave a single story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.poster.avif?t=1718089592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.webm?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.mp4?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Concept</h2>&quot;I have to go to work in a few hours...But I want to play a game! I want to clear the game! I want to be impressed!&quot;<br>The is &quot;super-concentrated action entertainment&quot; made for gamers who are exhausted from their work.<br><br>Clear the game loop in as little as 10 minutes, no game overs, super-concentrated action entertainment for busy working adults.<br>A breathless, furious action game in a dying world, an action adventure game where your discoveries and actions unravel a complex and intertwined world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.poster.avif?t=1718089592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.webm?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/3a504550a944c4ffccffc3af2154cd84.mp4?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Action and the Adventure</h2>At a glance, this game may look like any other 3D action game. But if you look closer, it's actually an action adventure game that mixes escape puzzle game elements into the action.<br><br>If you make it rain in this world, the desert in another might turn into a forest.<br>If you lose to a boss on purpose, you might gain an advantage against another.<br><br>Your own discoveries and choices are the key to solving the puzzle of these three intertwined worlds, across more than ten different stages which all affect one another.<br><br>When you clear all 30+ routes and finally reach the true ending, you're guaranteed to be filled with an overwhelming sense of accomplishment when all the puzzle pieces fall into place.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/badabe5cec0d6eac30f0993054214d03.poster.avif?t=1718089592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/badabe5cec0d6eac30f0993054214d03.webm?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134470/extras/badabe5cec0d6eac30f0993054214d03.mp4?t=1718089592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can clear the game before going to bed in as little as 10 minutes.<br></li><li>No tutorial, easy controls and exhilarating action.<br></li><li>Stress-free design with no game over even if you lose to a boss.<br></li><li>Play around to solve the mystery, the world keeps changing by player's choice.</li></ul><br>Enjoy a completely new game experience that fits into the small gaps in today's entertainment-filled society.",
